                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>In telegram 4178 from London, January 29, Ambassador Walter S. Gifford set forth
                    an analysis of differences between the United States and the United Kingdom
                    regarding policy in the Far East. Telegram 4178 and other material on United
                    States-United Kingdom relations with respect to the East Asian-Pacific area is
                    scheduled for publication in volume IV.</p>
            </div>
